hpc:SlurmdDaemonNonResponsiveness a owl:Class .
hpc:SlurmdLogFile a owl:Class .
hpc:SlurmctldLogFile a owl:Class .
hpc:NetworkProblem a owl:Class, rdfs:subClassOf hpc:SlurmdDaemonNonResponsiveness .
hpc:DisklessNodesEncounteringNetworkProblems a owl:Class, rdfs:subClassOf hpc:NetworkProblem .
hpc:SlowNetworkInformationService a owl:Class, rdfs:subClassOf hpc:NetworkProblem .
hpc:PrologScriptTakingALongTime a owl:Class, rdfs:subClassOf hpc:SlurmdDaemonNonResponsiveness .
hpc:CredentialReplayedError a owl:Class, rdfs:subClassOf hpc:SlurmdDaemonNonResponsiveness .
hpc:InvalidJobCredential a owl:Class, rdfs:subClassOf hpc:SlurmdDaemonNonResponsiveness .
hpc:TaskLaunchFailedOnNode a owl:Class, rdfs:subClassOf hpc:SlurmdDaemonNonResponsiveness .
hpc:TooManyOpenFilesError a owl:Class, rdfs:subClassOf hpc:SlurmdDaemonNonResponsiveness .
hpc:SlurmJobCredentialInconsistency a owl:Class, rdfs:subClassOf hpc:SlurmdDaemonNonResponsiveness .
hpc:SlurmJobCredentialFilesInconsistentAcrossCluster a owl:Class, rdfs:subClassOf hpc:SlurmJobCredentialInconsistency .
hpc:SlurmConfigureMessageTimeout a owl:Class, rdfs:subClassOf hpc:SlurmdDaemonNonResponsiveness .
hpc:SlurmDebugLoggingIssue a owl:Class, rdfs:subClassOf hpc:SlurmdDaemonNonResponsiveness .

hpc:hasLogFile a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:hasLogFile rdfs:domain hpc:SlurmdDaemonNonResponsiveness ;
                  rdfs:range hpc:LogFile .
hpc:isCausedBy a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:isCausedBy rdfs:domain hpc:SlurmdDaemonNonResponsiveness ;
                 rdfs:range hpc:Problem .
hpc:hasSolution a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:hasSolution rdfs:domain hpc:SlurmdDaemonNonResponsiveness ;
                 rdfs:range hpc:Solution .
hpc:hasFactor a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:hasFactor rdfs:domain hpc:SlurmdDaemonNonResponsiveness ;
                 rdfs:range hpc:Factor .
hpc:hasHardLimit a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:hasHardLimit rdfs:domain hpc:OpenFileLimit .
hpc:hasDebugLevel a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:hasDebugLevel rdfs:domain hpc:Program .
```

For the classes and properties related to the SlurmdDebug, I'll provide a simplified version as the provided text didn't provide enough details to create a comprehensive ontology.
